# Skills are regenerated from source via `just update-skills` (see .agents/SKILLS.md),
# not committed. The ui.sh and memtrace skills are authed/licensed and this repo is
# public, so their content must never be committed. Reproduce them with:
#   op signin && refresh-secrets && just update-skills
/.agents/skills/*
!/.agents/skills/.gitkeep
/opencode/skills/*
!/opencode/skills/.gitkeep
